=== login
--- calls
lib: mkdir
  -p
  /tmp/.cache
python3
  /app/fxprofile.py
  --profile-dir
  /secrets/angellist-fxprofile
python3
  /app/extract_cookies.py
  --db
  /secrets/angellist-fxprofile/cookies.sqlite
  --out
  /secrets/angellist-cookies.json
  --require-valid
python3
  /app/download.py
  --cookies
  /secrets/angellist-cookies.json
  --check
exit: 0
--- stdout
--- stderr
login: existing AngelList session still valid — cookie lifted to
login:   /secrets/angellist-cookies.json. No VNC login needed (pass --fresh to re-login).
=== login --help
--- calls
lib: mkdir
  -p
  /tmp/.cache
exit: 0
--- stdout
--- stderr
angellist login — BYO-cookie auth path.
  --check  probe the saved session (exit 0 valid / 1 stale); never opens Firefox.
  --fresh  skip the check and always re-login by hand over VNC.
  (no flag) probe; if stale, open Firefox under VNC for a by-hand login.
